      "   📈 Total applicant-patent relationships: 36806\n",
      "   🏢 Unique applicant names: 12800\n",
      "   🏭 Unique patent families: 18665\n",
      "   📅 Year range in data: 2000-2023\n",
      "   🏷️ Applicants with sector info: 36806 / 36806\n"
     ]
